LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 3070 Windward Plaza\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:Comedian and actor Pauly Shore first rose to fame in the 1990s 
 as the star of the MTV show\, "Totally Pauly"\, which led to starring roles
  in the films\, "Encino Man\," "Son In Law\," "In the Army Now\," and "Bio 
 Dome." Since then\, Pauly has starred and produced in a series of projects 
 for Showtime including "Adopted\," "Vegas Is My Oyster\," and "Pauly-Tics."
